      "changes": "Packages moved from app.morphe.extension to app.hushgram.extension so the payload can't collide with another Morphe source's classes. Instagram's hosts and cookie names in DiagnosticRedactor, Instagram wording in user-facing messages, HushfacebookPause renamed HushgramPause with its keys and marker file. The settings screen cut down to HushGram's patches: no Material You theme, search, section navigation, backups, release check or downloads. The Facebook compatibility target replaced with Instagram 449.0.0.52.84 and its two signer digests. LinkCleaner's key lists replaced with Instagram's own and limited to Instagram's hosts, with clipboard and share sheet stand-ins added. The extension and settings patches rewritten for InstagramAppShell and InstagramMainActivity. The translation tables pruned to the strings HushGram shows, with its new strings translated. Changed files carry a 'Modified for HushGram' line."
